  "content": "<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n  \n<img alt=\"Exposure\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/main.png\" width=225/>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n### 底片攝影模組\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img alt=\"相機\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_camera.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"底片\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_film.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"顯影\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_developing.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"沖印\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_printing.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"照片\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_photograph.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"附加功能\" width=\"260\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_additional_features.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"彩色效果\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_chromatic.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"穿越投影機\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_projector.gif\"/>\n<br><br>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/exposure-polaroid\"><img alt=\"拍立得\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_polaroid.png\"/></a>\n<br><br>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/exposure-catalog\"><img alt=\"目錄\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_catalog.png\"/></a>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"底片負片\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_negatives.png\"/>\n\n</div>\n\n<br>\n\n<details>\n  \n<summary>文字版說明</summary>\n<h3>相機</h3>\n\n- 操作相機非常簡單：裝入底片卷、打開觀景窗、構圖、按下快門。<br>\n- 在觀景窗模式下按住/按壓潛行鍵可調整相機設定：焦距、快門速度、閃光燈模式、構圖輔助線。<br>\n- 潛行時使用相機可開啟配件視窗，您可以在其中：\n    - 裝入底片\n    - 安裝閃光燈（紅石燈）\n    - 更換鏡頭（望遠鏡）\n    - 在鏡頭上裝濾鏡（玻璃片）\n\n<h3>底片</h3>\n\n- 要捕捉影像，您需要讓感光底片曝光。\n- 您可以使用簡單的黑白底片，或更精密、更難製作和處理的彩色底片。\n- 單卷底片可容納16張畫面。\n- 要沖印底片，必須先進行顯影處理。\n\n<h3>暗房</h3>\n\n- 照片是透過暗房方塊沖印出來的。\n- 沖印前可以預覽底片負片，幫助您選擇最佳曝光。\n- 黑白照片需要紙張和黑色染料。\n- 彩色照片則額外需要青色、洋紅色和黃色染料。\n\n<h3>照片</h3>\n\n最終，您將得到一張照片——捕捉下永恆的瞬間！\n現在是時候欣賞成果、將它掛在牆上、與朋友分享、甚至賣給國家地理雜誌。可能性是無限的。\n\n</details>\n\n<iframe width=\"1000\" height=\"350\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HI9Bnjc9HYs\" title=\"YouTube This Mod Adds Photography in Minecraft!\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<br><br>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n<h1><a href=\"https://moddedmc.wiki/en/project/exposure/latest/docs\">Wiki</a></h1>\n\n__已知不相容問題：__\n\n</div>\n\n- Optifine - 已知會導致與其他模組的衝突。請改用 Sodium/Embeddium。\n- Visual Overhaul - 開啟相機控制時會崩潰 - [GitHub Issue](https://github.com/mortuusars/Exposure/issues/19)\n- Exordium - 使用觀景窗時會造成問題和畫面閃爍。\n- FastAnim (Fabric) - 導致使用相機時玩家模型動畫異常。[Github Issue](https://github.com/mortuusars/Exposure/issues/71)\n\n<h1> </h1>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n#### 喜歡這個模組嗎？您的支持能讓我繼續開發它及其他模組！\n[<img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/patreon_seamless.png\" width=558.73/>](https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars/membership)[<img alt=\"PayPal\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/paypal_seamless.png\" width=191.75/>](https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=4VPMCBCLZVUEA)\n[<img alt=\"黃金相機\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_golden_camera.png\" width=1000/>](https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars/posts/rewards-129739244)\n\n<h1> </h1>\n\n[<img alt=\"Discord 伺服器\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/discord.png\" width=500/>](https://discord.gg/FzHKGDW2et)\n\n</div>",
